2026-07-27T09:24:37.5979899Z i /tmp/RtmpGcEA9J/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:24:37.5980323Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:24:37.5980893Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:24:37.5981297Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:24:37.5981924Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:24:37.5982865Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:24:37.5983920Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
